/* SD2Cloud -- the ids of the texts on screen, in the order of lang/en.txt. The texts are in lang/, a file per
 * language (en.txt is the original), built into the program and read by i18n.c. A new text gets its id here and its
 * text in en.txt and pt.txt (tools/check_messages.py --sync puts it in the other languages' files, to be translated);
 * tools/check_messages.py checks every file against this list and measures each text with the font. */
